              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "bāoguǒ — \"parcel; package\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "zhège bāoguǒ shì nǐ de ma — Is this parcel yours?"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Its characters come later; for now it is a word for the ear."
            }
          ]
        },
